## Experiment loop

1. Establish the baseline on the root node and record its metric. Do not edit the root afterwards.
2. For each hypothesis, branch a child, change code/config only, run the fixed command, record
   the metric and a one-line conclusion.
3. Fan out a little within a round (the options of one decision), then descend onto that round's
   winner. Grow the tree downward, not sideways.
4. A disappointing result is still a result: keep it, note why, move on.

